  "id": "memory/a-ranked-label-cuts-the-name-it-disclaims-to-24-characters",
  "title": "The name a ranked label says its sender is not is whole within 24 characters, else cut at a word when a space comes after its thirteenth character, inside its word otherwise, and ended with an ellipsis",
